WEBVTT

00:04:57.995 --> 00:05:03.224
in a field hospital in Tahrir, and I decided to take a no of

00:05:03.224 --> 00:05:05.538
Mamluk Mausoleum in Cairo.

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:07.323
The message reads,

00:05:07.323 --> 00:05:13.732
[Arabic]

00:05:13.732 --> 00:05:17.409
"You can crush the flowers, but you can't delay spring."

00:05:17.409 --> 00:05:21.264
Thank you. (Applause)

00:05:21.264 --> 00:05:30.285
(Applause)